        <div class="s-char-text">

                                                                            <p><p>The <b>Indonesian short-nosed fruit bat</b> (<i>Cynopterus titthaecheilus</i> ) is a species of megabat in the family Pteropodidae. It is endemic to <a href="/indonesia-animals">Indonesia</a>, and has three subspecies:</p></p>
